    "detailed_description": "D\u00eerok is a unique game. First, because it is the first game that combines Connect Four with deck building, and second, because it is the first real-time turn-based game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis means that while it's your turn to make your move, things are still happening on the board. This introduces a new level of strategy never seen before.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, the game features more than 100 real historical figures with whom you can build your deck, and each will have a bio that helps us learn more about who they were.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs if that weren't enough, the characters will have different levels of strength, defense, health, and agility, as well as unique abilities that can positively affect allies and/or negatively affect enemies, potentially changing the dynamics of the game at any moment.",
